Modifications by Le Tuan Hai (https://github.com/letuanhai):

- Added studioweb connection type for connecting to SAS Studio via
  browser session ID and cookie (client/src/connection/studioweb/)
- Added QuickFileBrowser keyboard-driven file navigator
  (client/src/components/ContentNavigator/QuickFileBrowser.ts)
- Enhanced DataViewer with column management, selection, drag reorder,
  and SQLite export
  (client/src/components/LibraryNavigator/, client/src/webviewer/)
- Added SAS log output dataset display, library properties viewer,
  error/warning summary, and submission detail fetch
- Added universal TextMate grammar for SAS log highlighting
- Added LSP code folding for do/end, select/end, %do/%end blocks
- Removed Python/Pyright LSP support (replaced with no-op stub)
- Removed browser/web extension build target
- See CHANGELOG.md for the full change history
